BULLETIN BOARD

A - Read this topic
:A
READ THIS TOPIC

Type RBBS at the CP/M prompt to enter the bulletin board.
Follow its sign-on and registration prompts and its command menus.
Use the board's normal exit option to return to the CP/M prompt.

The board keeps its own messages and user records in private storage.
Those records are not ordinary caller-accessible archive files.
Ending a call does not erase your registered board account.

MESSAGE leaves a message for the sysop outside the board.
BYE ends the call. See HELP LOGOFF.
